####################################
Panel Data on Landtagswahl Results from 2011-2021 in Mecklenburg-Vorpommern (absolute numbers)
Author: Lisa-Marie Zikesch Date: 09. April 2026
####################################

Rmds included:
Landtagswahlen 2011-2021 Mecklenburg-Vorpommern.Rmd
wahlkreise.Rmd

Landtagswahlen 2011-2021 Mecklenburg-Vorpommern.Rmd
- cleans datasets on state elections
- merges data into paneldataset for state elections of 2011, 2016, 2021 in Mecklenburg-Vorpommern with absolute numbers
- writes out csv file for panel dataset

wahlkreise.Rmd
- pulls municipalities included in constituencies from 2016 and 2021
- writes out csv file for 2016 data

Rmds do not build on each other and can be run in no predefined order

